dbFailed.body:
Bismuth could not open your data. Nothing was deleted.

Close and reopen the program. If it keeps happening, tell the hotel owner and do not delete this folder:
{{folder}}

dbFailed.withBackup:
Bismuth could not prepare your data after an update. Nothing was deleted.

Backup made before the update:
{{path}}

Data folder:
{{folder}}

Tell the hotel owner; do not delete the backup or the folder.

integrity.body:
Bismuth checked your data at start-up and found a problem. The program keeps working; nothing was deleted.

Tell the hotel owner and do not delete this folder:
{{folder}}

crash.body:
Bismuth ran into something unexpected. Everything you saved is kept.

Restart the program. If it keeps happening, tell the hotel owner; the error log is in this folder (it holds no personal data):
{{folder}}

windowGone.body:
The Bismuth window closed because of a problem. Everything you saved is kept; only a form left unsaved may be lost.

Open the window again. If it keeps happening, tell the hotel owner; the error log is in this folder:
{{folder}}

windowLoop.body:
The Bismuth window closed several times in a short while and was opened again each time. Everything you saved is kept.

Restart the program. If it keeps happening, restart the computer and tell the hotel owner; the error log is in this folder:
{{folder}}
